// Shared settings for the test_real_* profiles: real, miniaturised runs on
// sandpit-tokyo, so the tools run on real data and not just the wiring that
// `-stub` checks. Cluster only, not CI; combine with the cluster profile:
//
//     nextflow run . -profile cluster,test_real_nanopore
//
// The fixtures, each set as params.input by its profile in nextflow.config:
//
//   test_real_illumina  fixtures/nextseq-mini/261006_VH02427_108_AAJJW55M5
//                       NextSeq 2000, InterOp, Reports/ and a read subset.
//   test_real_aviti     /mnt/instrument-data/element_aviti_1/
//                       20260924_GBI-Elements_SEQEBA000015, the full run read
//                       in place, with bases2fastq limited to 2 tiles (~13 min
//                       when the run is warm in Alluxio; ~2 h more when cold).
//   test_real_nanopore  fixtures/p24-mini/20260515_Plasmids_A_B (653 MB):
//                       3 POD5 each from barcode01/02, mixed, unclassified and
//                       barcode11. Needs a GPU node for dorado.
//   test_real_pacbio    fixtures/revio-mini/r84334_20260817_141703 (881 MB):
//                       SMRT Cell 1_A01 only, 8 barcodes.
//
// fixtures/ is /mnt/lustre/users/pauline-fourgoux/fixtures/, readable by all users.

params {
    outdir = 'results-test-real'
    overwrite = true
}
